/-- Phase 5FB full-ledger root source projected from the continuum alignment
bundle.

This projection reads the analytic first-root formula, nonnegativity, root
provenance, survival-root identity, and cap from the typed replay payload. -/
noncomputable def ContinuumPhase5FBSigmaMatrixAlignmentSource.phase5fbRootSource
    {τ : ContinuumLPProfileTopology.{u}}
    {profile_family_of_block : FullLedgerBlock → PricingProfileFamily}
    {self_tax_source :
      LeraySelfTaxContinuumAllOutputProfilePriceStreamFamilySource τ}
    {lipschitz_bridge : LowFrequencyLipschitzBridge}
